                    "condition_applied": "antilife_shell_aura",
                    "description": "Engine-level pathing blocker. Excludes 'undead' and 'constructs'. Prevents affected creatures from pathing into the radius or making standard melee attacks through it. Reach and ranged attacks bypass this."
                },
                {
                    "effect_type": "utility",
                    "utility_action": "dispel",
